		<h2 class="post-title">Stage 1 Fire Restrictions in place effective Aug. 20, 2026</h2>

		
		<div  class="single-details">

			<p>
				
				Posted on August 20, 2026			
				<span><a href=" https://www.douglasco.gov/category/2026/">2026</a></span><span><a href=" https://www.douglasco.gov/category/breaking-news/">News and Events</a></span>			
			</p>

